Open Chinese Convert (OpenCC) character dictionaries
====================================================

This directory vendors two data files from the Open Chinese Convert (OpenCC)
project, unmodified:

  - STCharacters.txt  (Simplified -> Traditional character table)
  - TSCharacters.txt  (Traditional -> Simplified character table)

